/**
 * LANDMARK LYMPHOMA TRIALS: the studies that set, de-escalated or failed to change the standard, written as
 * records. Facet C of the lymphoma deep dive, 1 October 2026.
 *
 * Every `nct` was read from the ClinicalTrials.gov v2 API on 1 October 2026, and `started`, `startedType`,
 * `sponsor` and the registry enrolment come from that record. Where the publication analysed a different
 * population from the registry figure, `enrolled` carries the paper's number and `enrolledBasis` and
 * `enrolledNote` say which and why. Every figure in `result`, `outcomes` and `summary` is from the indexed
 * abstract of the paper named in `keyPapers`.
 *
 * Trials the corpus already held are not here. POLARIX, ECHELON-1, ECHELON-2, HD21, RATHL, ZUMA-1, ZUMA-5,
 * ZUMA-7, TRANSFORM, BELINDA, EPCORE NHL-1, TRIANGLE, GALLIUM, RELEVANCE, ALCANZA, IELSG32 and MATRix/IELSG43
 * exist by those ids; ELM-2, ECHELON-3, inMIND and ECHO exist under their registry ids
 * (REGISTRY_ID_TRIALS in ./lymphoma-evidence-shared.ts) and are supplemented in ./lymphoma-evidence.ts.
 *
 * Diseases with no cancer record yet (extranodal NK/T-cell lymphoma, adult T-cell leukaemia/lymphoma) are named
 * in words and attached to the nearest record that exists; facet A owns those pages.
 */

